{"version": 2, "width": 160, "height": 50, "timestamp": 1787162527, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-ghostty"}, "title": "SPIFFE Token Exchange — CEO Identity Descoping (PR #2772)"}
[3.039666, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[3.040195, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.040232, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  SPIFFE Token Exchange — CEO Identity Descoping\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[4.048755, "o", "  \u001b[1mPR #2772: Identity Delegation + SPIFFE Token Exchange\u001b[0m\r\n  OpenShell sandbox + Keycloak RHBK + ZTWIM/SPIRE on ROSA HCP\r\n\r\n"]
[4.048925, "o", "  \u001b[1mWhat's new vs the previous demo:\u001b[0m\r\n    - CEO delegates identity via \u001b[0;36m--delegate-identity-for\u001b[0m (PR #2772)\r\n"]
[4.048955, "o", "    - Token exchange uses \u001b[0;36mSPIFFE JWT-SVIDs\u001b[0m (no stored credentials)\r\n"]
[4.049341, "o", "    - Descoping enforced by the \u001b[0;36mtoken-exchange-issuer\u001b[0m (not Keycloak client scopes)\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mRFE:\u001b[0m RHAIRFE-2567 — user identity delegation for external services\r\n\r\n"]
[8.061127, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.061242, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Architecture — SPIFFE Token Exchange Flow\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[9.072974, "o", "  \u001b[0;35mCEO\u001b[0m logs in via Keycloak OIDC (openshell gateway login)\r\n    │\r\n"]
[9.073151, "o", "    │ \u001b[2m--delegate-identity-for 1h\u001b[0m\r\n    ▼\r\n  \u001b[0;36mGateway\u001b[0m (PR #2772, openshell-system)\r\n    │ SPIFFE ID: spiffe://openshell.local/ns/openshell-system/sa/openshell\r\n"]
[9.073234, "o", "    │ Stores CEO OIDC refresh token, renews automatically\r\n    │\r\n    │ \u001b[2msandbox create --provider bank-access --delegate-identity-for 1h\u001b[0m\r\n    ▼\r\n  \u001b[0;36mSandbox\u001b[0m (bank-demo namespace)\r\n    │ SPIFFE ID: spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/<uuid>\r\n    │ Zero credentials — token exchange happens at proxy level\r\n"]
[9.073253, "o", "    │\r\n    │ \u001b[2mcurl bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m\r\n    ▼\r\n  \u001b[0;32mToken Exchange (2-step):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.073279, "o", "    1. Gateway → Issuer: CEO OIDC token + Gateway SVID → intermediate token\r\n"]
[9.073386, "o", "    2. Supervisor → Issuer: intermediate + Sandbox SVID → \u001b[0;31mdescoped\u001b[0m final token\r\n"]
[9.073463, "o", "    │\r\n    ▼\r\n  \u001b[1;33mbank-api\u001b[0m receives: sub=ceo, scope=\u001b[0;32mread-only\u001b[0m, azp=sandbox SPIFFE ID\r\n\r\n"]
[13.084092, "o", "\r\n"]
[13.08425, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Cluster State\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.084331, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[14.098874, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Running pods\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.113567, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.113865, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc get pods -n openshell-system -l app.kubernetes.io/name=openshell\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.251938, "o", "openshell-0   1/1   Running   0     32m\r\n"]
[16.259223, "o", "\r\n"]
[16.259273, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc get pods -n bank-demo\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.503694, "o", "bank-api-85568789dd-8qqpm                1/1   Running   0     11m\r\ndefault--ceo-agent                       1/1   Running   0     29m\r\ntoken-exchange-issuer-6f967c6c7d-5mtbd   2/2   Running   0     13m\r\n"]
[17.512053, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.527781, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ SPIFFE identities (ZTWIM/SPIRE)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.538457, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ spire-server entry show | grep 'openshell-system\\|sandbox/'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[22.876613, "o", "  SPIFFE ID        : spiffe://openshell.local/ns/openshell-system/sa/openshell\r\n  SPIFFE ID        : spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n"]
[22.877709, "o", "\r\n"]
[25.889696, "o", "\r\n"]
[25.889778, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 1: CEO Identity — who am I?\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[26.900298, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ CEO authenticated via Keycloak OIDC\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[27.912153, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ openshell whoami\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[31.345645, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36mCurrent User\u001b[39m\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mSubject:\u001b[0m aba5bbf7-d673-4c20-a83d-10a0fcf36a53\r\n"]
[31.345988, "o", "  \u001b[2mName:\u001b[0m ceo\r\n  \u001b[2mProvider:\u001b[0m oidc\r\n"]
[31.346092, "o", "  \u001b[2mRoles:\u001b[0m openshell-user, offline_access, default-roles-bank-demo, uma_authorization, openshell-admin\r\n  \u001b[2mScopes:\u001b[0m \r\n"]
[31.350565, "o", "\r\n"]
[34.360841, "o", "\r\n"]
[34.360975, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 2: Sandbox with Delegated Identity\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[35.369869, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Sandbox created with --delegate-identity-for 1h and --provider bank-access\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[36.379058, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox delegated-identity status ceo-agent\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.353716, "o", "Delegated identity: enabled\r\nCredential ID:       delegated-identity-1bfbd816411f9ff9a06e14aaebb5e6b2385255e82081be7ae81e715f34d374d7\r\nPrincipal:           aba5bbf7-d673-4c20-a83d-10a0fcf36a53\r\nStatus:              active\r\nValid for:           29m\r\n"]
[37.35884, "o", "\r\n"]
[37.358917, "o", "  The CEO's OIDC identity is \u001b[0;36mdelegated\u001b[0m to the sandbox for 1 hour.\r\n  The gateway holds the refresh token and renews it automatically.\r\n"]
[37.361175, "o", "  The sandbox has \u001b[0;31mzero credentials\u001b[0m — the proxy handles token exchange.\r\n\r\n"]
[40.378018, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ What's inside the sandbox?\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[41.390927, "o", "\r\n"]
[41.391944, "o", "\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox exec -n ceo-agent -- whoami\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[42.699075, "o", "sandbox\r\r\n"]
[42.702468, "o", "\r\n"]
[42.702618, "o", "\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox exec -n ceo-agent -- printenv | grep -iE 'token|secret|key|password'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[44.024473, "o", "  (no secrets found)\r\n\r\n"]
[44.02475, "o", "  \u001b[0;32mZero credentials in the sandbox.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.036862, "o", "\r\n"]
[47.036904, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 3: SPIFFE Token Exchange in Action\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[47.037148, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[48.048174, "o", "  \u001b[0;35m\u001b[1m[CEO Agent]\u001b[0m I call bank-api/whoami — the token exchange happens transparently.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m$ openshell sandbox exec -n ceo-agent -- curl bank-api.bank-demo.svc.cluster.local/whoami\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[49.51211, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"sub\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"preferred_username\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"email\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"accounts.read transfers.read profile email\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[49.512291, "o", "  \u001b[1;34m\"azp\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"iss\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"http://token-exchange-issuer.bank-demo.svc.cluster.local\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"token_use\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"final\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[49.513618, "o", "\r\n"]
[49.513764, "o", "  \u001b[1msub: ceo\u001b[0m              ← CEO identity preserved\r\n  \u001b[1mscope: accounts.read\u001b[0m  ← \u001b[0;31mdescoped to read-only\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[49.513914, "o", "  \u001b[1mazp: spiffe://.../sandbox/...\u001b[0m ← sandbox SPIFFE identity\r\n\r\n"]
[52.523493, "o", "\r\n"]
[52.523582, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 4: Descoping — CEO can read but NOT write\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[52.523837, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[53.534489, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ GET /accounts — ALLOWED (accounts.read)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[54.542557, "o", "\u001b[2m$ curl GET bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[55.880577, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"email\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"accounts.read transfers.read profile email\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"azp\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"accounts\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[1;39m[\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ACC-001\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"owner\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"balance\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m5000000\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"executive\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ACC-002\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"owner\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"analyst@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"balance\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m85000\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39"]
[55.880785, "o", "m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"standard\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"id\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ACC-003\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"owner\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"intern@bank.com\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"balance\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;39m32000\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[1;34m\"type\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"standard\"\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;39m]\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[55.881829, "o", "\r\n"]
[55.881953, "o", "  \u001b[0;32mCEO sees all accounts (read allowed)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[58.893181, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ POST /accounts — DENIED (accounts.write descoped)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[59.903713, "o", "\u001b[2m$ curl POST bank-api/accounts\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[61.354188, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"error\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"missing scope: accounts.write — agent is descoped to read-only\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"accounts.read transfers.read profile email\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[61.355184, "o", "\r\n"]
[61.355303, "o", "  \u001b[0;31mBLOCKED — agent cannot create accounts even as CEO\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[64.367711, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ POST /transfers — DENIED (transfers.write descoped)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[65.376771, "o", "\u001b[2m$ curl POST bank-api/transfers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[66.710079, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"error\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"missing scope: transfers.write — agent cannot initiate transfers\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"user\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"ceo\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"scope\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"accounts.read transfers.read profile email\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[66.711453, "o", "\r\n"]
[66.711645, "o", "  \u001b[0;31mBLOCKED — agent cannot initiate transfers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[69.723201, "o", "\r\n"]
[69.723268, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Step 5: Token Exchange Audit Trail\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[70.734563, "o", "\u001b[1;33m\u001b[1m▸ Token exchange issuer logs\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[71.746456, "o", "\r\n"]
[71.746829, "o", "\u001b[2m$ oc logs -n bank-demo -l app=token-exchange-issuer -c token-issuer\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[73.266549, "o", "  INTERMEDIATE exchange: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com gateway=spiffe://openshell.local/ns/openshell-system/sa/openshell audience=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n  FINAL exchange: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com scope=accounts.read transfers.read client=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n  INTERMEDIATE exchange: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com gateway=spiffe://openshell.local/ns/openshell-system/sa/openshell audience=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n  FINAL exchange: user=ceo email=ceo@bank.com scope=accounts.read transfers.read client=spiffe://openshell.local/openshell/sandbox/0d07bee1-bd6c-4f8d-a0ae-bc49813609e7\r\n"]
[73.268174, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1mEach exchange is logged:\u001b[0m user, email, scopes, SPIFFE client ID\r\n"]
[76.279466, "o", "\r\n"]
[76.279602, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m  Summary — RHAIRFE-2567 with PR #2772\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[76.279618, "o", "\u001b[0;36m\u001b[1m════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[77.292501, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1mWhat's demonstrated:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[77.292583, "o", "  \u001b[0;32m1. Identity delegation\u001b[0m   CEO delegates via --delegate-identity-for\r\n  \u001b[0;32m2. SPIFFE token exchange\u001b[0m  2-step: gateway SVID + supervisor SVID\r\n  \u001b[0;32m3. Scope descoping\u001b[0m       write scopes stripped, read-only for agents\r\n  \u001b[0;32m4. Zero credentials\u001b[0m      no tokens, keys, or secrets in the sandbox\r\n"]
[77.292811, "o", "  \u001b[0;32m5. Audit trail\u001b[0m           every exchange logged with user + scopes + SPIFFE ID\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mvs previous demo (Keycloak-only):\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Previous: Keycloak client scope mapping enforces descoping\r\n  \u001b[0;36mNow:      SPIFFE identity + token exchange issuer enforces descoping\u001b[0m\r\n            No credential stored anywhere — not even at the gateway\r\n"]
[77.292837, "o", "            Sandbox identity is cryptographic (SPIFFE), not a shared secret\r\n"]
[77.292849, "o", "\r\n"]
[77.292992, "o", "  \u001b[2mRFE: RHAIRFE-2567    Cluster: akram-dev (ROSA HCP 4.22)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mPRs: #1970 + #2772   SPIFFE: ZTWIM v1.1.0    IdP: RHBK v26.6\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
